# Patch notes for spacetimedb@2.10.1:
# - Upstream still serializes Result.err with variants[0]; use variants[1].
# - Upstream Prettify still maps primitives; preserve primitive types directly.
# - Upstream TableCache still compares object-backed range operands with raw
#   JavaScript ordering; normalize every supported native scalar first.
# - Upstream server index uniqueness checks use subset membership, causing a
#   prefix index of a composite unique constraint to lose its range methods;
#   require exact column-set equality.
# - All four dispositions were re-verified against the published 2.10.1
#   tarball: every transform below matched the unpatched upstream text, so
#   each defect is still present. Bun patches apply only to workspace
#   installs; a published npm consumer does not receive these fixes
#   automatically.
# - This file is regenerated by the source repository for every SpacetimeDB
#   version bump; do not edit it by hand.

